#### Styling Customization

Style the component only through its documented `--mds-{{componentNameWithNoPrefix}}-*` CSS custom properties. Paint with the semantic color roles via `rgb(var(--magma-<role>))` so dark mode, named themes and high contrast keep working - see [`docs/agents/color.md`](../../../../../../docs/agents/color.md).

```css
.my-{{componentNameWithNoPrefix}} {
  /* --mds-{{componentNameWithNoPrefix}}-... properties go here */
}
```
